ct with guests and callers (some normal, some ...interesting)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice professionalism and stay on task; unauthorized access of company systems is strictly prohibited.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A distant motel. A string of murders. Use your wits to investigate a series of unexplained deaths in this murder mystery job simulator. Welcome to the Moonlight Motel.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669810/ea93d779292735fd2434efeb8c2fa24ef874d314/header.jpg?t=1780243049", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669810/932d246478bee056d5f237e12e2963aab8cd74ea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780243049", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669810/932d246478bee056d5f237e12e2963aab8cd74ea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780243049", "website": "https://hired2die.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core I5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 970 / RX 580 - 6GB VRAM</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Electric Monkeys"], "publishers": ["Black Lantern Collective"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 55, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 56, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 57, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 58, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 59, "description": "Steam Input API Support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres